#!/usr/bin/env bash
# Thin wrapper: the work lives in avocado-build-x86, shared by every Intel
# x86-64 machine in this layer. The SDK installs one of these per machine
# because avocado-cli invokes the hook by target name.
exec "$(dirname "$(readlink -f "$0")")/avocado-build-x86" intel-x86-64-v2 "$@"
